sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Istio as Istio Gateway<br/>VirtualService
    participant AuthZ as Istio AuthorizationPolicy
    participant Registry as model-registry<br/>8080/TCP REST
    participant BFF as BFF Server<br/>4000/TCP
    participant DB as PostgreSQL/MySQL<br/>GORM
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as controller-controller-manager
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService
    participant AsyncJob as async-upload Job<br/>Python
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,S3: User Request Path (Registry API)
    Client->>Istio: HTTPS Request<br/>/api/model_registry/*
    Istio->>AuthZ: Check policy
    AuthZ-->>Istio: Validate JWT + principal<br/>(ns: kubeflow, sa: istio-ingressgateway)
    Istio->>Registry: HTTP Forward
    Registry->>DB: GORM Query<br/>(model metadata CRUD)
    DB-->>Registry: Result
    Registry-->>Istio: JSON Response
    Istio-->>Client: HTTPS Response

    Note over Client,S3: BFF Proxy Path (UI)
    Client->>Istio: HTTPS Request<br/>/model-registry/*
    Istio->>AuthZ: Check principal identity
    Istio->>BFF: HTTP Forward
    BFF->>BFF: Validate Bearer/SA Token<br/>(auth-method flag)
    BFF->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA Token, TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Authorization Result
    BFF->>Registry: REST API Proxy
    Registry->>DB: Query
    DB-->>Registry: Result
    Registry-->>BFF: Response
    BFF-->>Istio: Response
    Istio-->>Client: HTTPS Response

    Note over Client,S3: Controller Reconciliation
    KServe-->>Controller: InferenceService Watch Event
    Controller->>K8sAPI: List Services<br/>(label: component=model-registry)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Registry Service Endpoints
    Controller->>Registry: Sync Serving URLs<br/>(OpenAPI client)
    Registry->>DB: Update serving state
    DB-->>Registry: OK

    Note over Client,S3: Async Model Upload
    BFF->>K8sAPI: Create Job<br/>(batch/v1/Job)
    K8sAPI-->>BFF: Job Created
    K8sAPI->>AsyncJob: Start Pod
    AsyncJob->>S3: Copy Model<br/>boto3, AWS IAM Auth
    S3-->>AsyncJob: Model Artifacts
    AsyncJob->>AsyncJob: Sigstore Model Signing
    AsyncJob->>Registry: Register Model<br/>REST API
    Registry->>DB: Store Metadata
    DB-->>Registry: OK
    Registry-->>AsyncJob: Registered
